      "trackName": "CrossWatch: Crossword Watch",
      "description": "The crossword puzzle, reimagined for your wrist.\nCrossWatch is a compact 5x5 crossword designed exclusively for Apple Watch. Words interlock across and down — tap tiles, place letters, and solve the grid in seconds.\n\nDAILY CHALLENGE\nOne new crossword every day at midnight. Same puzzle for everyone, one chance to solve it. Come back tomorrow for the next one.\n\nQUICK PLAY\nWant more? Generate unlimited random crosswords anytime. No waiting, no limits.\n\nBUILT-IN HINTS\nStuck on a tough crossing? Use up to 3 hints per puzzle to reveal a correct letter.\n\nWORD CLUES\nEach crossword comes with directional clues showing word length and starting letter to guide you.\n\nMADE FOR APPLE WATCH\nClean white grid with crisp typography\nTap-to-type letter picker optimized for small screens\nInstant solve detection with color feedback\nFully standalone — no phone needed\nPerfect for filling a spare minute with a quick mental challenge.",
